    "catalogue_description": "Hello folks i am hereby publishing my first ever custom zombies map. It is called Stone Domain. To access it solo type devmap nazi_zombie_stonedomain in console and in cooperative it functions too with friends. Features -Hellhounds (In own rounds) -Soldier Boy Bosses (Boss zombies that spawn in zombie rounds with normal zombies. Have larger health and are dressed in USA Army Raider uniforms.) -4 Basic Perks -Functional Power Ups -Pack A Punch -Mystery Box -Plenty Of Wall Buys Have fun playing it!",
